 to an address or parcel."],[3,"Administrative revisions and contract totals do not establish build completion, activation or speed at a parcel."],[4,"Submitted or planned network build is not accepted as current parcel service until published outputs and the exact corrected-r2 join pass."],[5,"A regulatory consultation and reporting framework do not prove network availability, security or resilience at a parcel."],[6,"Tariff eligibility, advertised price and product speed do not establish provider availability or measured speed at a parcel."],[7,"A licensing process decision does not prove satellite capacity, terminal eligibility or active broadband service at an address."],[8,"Provider complaint rates are aggregate indicators and cannot be converted into parcel-level service quality or coverage."],[9,"Charter commitments do not demonstrate that a particular line has migrated or that backup power and alternative connectivity are operational."],[10,"Incident-reporting obligations do not establish that an incident occurred or that a network is secure and resilient at a parcel."],[11,"General policy and legal duties are not evidence of individual-provider compliance or live parcel connectivity."],[12,"Scheme participation and compensation rules do not prove a fault, appointment, activation date or payment entitlement for a parcel."],[13,"Spectrum authorisation and priority rules do not prove deployment, indoor coverage or measured throughput at a parcel."],[14,"Resilience guidance does not verify actual redundancy, power backup, restoration time or service continuity at an address."],[15,"National availability and operator predictions remain fail-closed and are not exact parcel measurements without the corrected-r2 join."]],"probe_evidence":{"official_or_public_sources_only":true,"parallel_source_streams":15,"repository_route_deduplication":"PASS_12_NEW_3_REFRESHED","binary_download_attempted":false,"binary_download_result":"NOT_RETRIED_KNOWN_ENVIRONMENT_LIMIT_FAIL_CL